{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23442","headline":"余思未尽加爲六韵重寄微之 · 白居易","name":"余思未尽加爲六韵重寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海内声华并在身，箧中文字绝无伦。\n遥知独对封章草，忽忆同爲献纳臣。\n走笔往来盈卷轴，除官递互掌丝纶。\n制从长庆辞高古，诗到元和体变新。\n各有文姬才稚齿，俱无通子继余尘。\n琴书何必求王粲，与女犹胜与外人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23442.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23442","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}